    "detailed_description": "Alchemy Frogs is a local co-op puzzle platformer game with a 3D, isometric camera, in which Frog &amp; Toad traverse a poisoned magical swampy forest to look for a cure that will help them save their family from being turned to stone. Together, the players must use their personal porta-cauldrons to brew potions and then throw them at hazards spawned by the mysterious plague. Frog &amp; Toad will mix their potions to unleash powerful magical effects, growing plants over dangerous salt pits or exploding obstacles with alchemical dynamite.",
